<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark light">
    <meta name="generator" content="wikicc">
    <title>{{ title }}</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="{{ favicon|safe }}">
    <style>{{ css|safe }}</style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#doc-content">Skip to content</a>
    <noscript>
      <p class="noscript">This reader needs JavaScript to display the documents.</p>
    </noscript>
    <div class="app" id="app">
      <!-- The rail is the page's leftmost strip and never moves: a fixed home for
       the switches that answer for the sidebar's two views. The drawer's
       toggle and the collapse switch select the document list — the drawer's
       toggle on the phone, where the sidebar is a drawer over the page, the
       collapse switch on the wider layouts, where it is a column — and the
       outline's switch under them selects the chapter outline. The views are
       mutually exclusive: one shows at a time, and the switch whose view is
       showing puts the sidebar away when pressed again. -->
      <div class="rail" id="rail">
        <button class="icon-button"
                id="sidebar-toggle"
                type="button"
                aria-label="Toggle document list"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="sidebar">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16" />
          </svg>
        </button>
        <button class="icon-button"
                id="sidebar-collapse"
                type="button"
                aria-label="Hide document list"
                aria-expanded="true"
                aria-controls="sidebar"
                title="Hide document list">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="12" rx="2" />
            <path d="M4 16V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10v2" />
          </svg>
        </button>
        <button class="icon-button"
                id="outline-toggle"
                type="button"
                aria-label="Show outline panel"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="toc-panel"
                title="Show outline panel">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M4 6h16M8 12h12M8 18h8" />
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>
      <aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar" aria-label="Document navigation">
        <header class="sidebar-header">
          <p class="site-title" title="{{ title }}">{{ title }}</p>
        </header>
        <!-- The sidebar shows one view at a time. The list is the site's table of
         contents and nothing else: a search field here would be a second way
         in to the same documents, and it cannot show what it found —
         searching lives in the right rail. The outline is the open document's
         chapters. The rail's switches trade one view for the other. -->
        <div class="side-docs" id="side-docs">
          <nav class="doc-list" id="doc-list" aria-label="Documents">
          </nav>
          <footer class="sidebar-footer" id="stats">
          </footer>
        </div>
        <section class="toc-panel" id="toc-panel" aria-labelledby="toc-heading">
          <h2 class="panel-heading" id="toc-heading">Outline</h2>
          <nav class="toc" id="toc" aria-label="Chapter outline">
          </nav>
        </section>
      </aside>
      <main class="content" id="doc-content" tabindex="-1">
        <!-- The banner slot is filled once by `banner.js` and only toggled
         afterwards, so a message never reflows the article. -->
        <div class="doc-alert"
             id="doc-alert"
             role="status"
             aria-live="polite"
             aria-hidden="true"
             hidden></div>
        <article class="doc-article" id="doc-article"></article>
      </main>
      <aside class="inspector" id="inspector" aria-label="Graph">
        <!-- One panel per view, and one at a time on screen: the body attribute
         `data-graph-view` picks which. Each draws from its own container, so
         a picture a reader has arranged survives the other view being shown
         and hiding it again. The panel is a floating window above the page
         rather than a column of the grid: it hangs at the top right, out of
         the page's flow, so opening it never moves the article. The
         backlinks panel is the window's third view: not a picture but the
         list of the documents that link to the one being read, which the
         build resolved and the payload carries. The tags panel is the
         fourth: the aggregation the build collected from the bodies, whose
         rows filter the document list. -->
        <section class="panel graph-panel"
                 id="graph-local-panel"
                 aria-labelledby="graph-local-heading">
          <div class="panel-header">
            <h2 class="panel-heading" id="graph-local-heading">Local graph</h2>
            <button class="panel-action"
                    id="graph-fit-local"
                    type="button"
                    title="Fit graph to view"
                    aria-label="Fit graph to view">Fit</button>
          </div>
          <div class="graph" id="graph-local"></div>
        </section>
        <section class="panel graph-panel"
                 id="graph-global-panel"
                 aria-labelledby="graph-global-heading">
          <div class="panel-header">
            <h2 class="panel-heading" id="graph-global-heading">Global graph</h2>
            <button class="panel-action"
                    id="graph-fit-global"
                    type="button"
                    title="Fit graph to view"
                    aria-label="Fit graph to view">Fit</button>
          </div>
          <div class="graph" id="graph-global"></div>
        </section>
        <section class="panel"
                 id="backlinks-panel"
                 aria-labelledby="backlinks-heading">
          <div class="panel-header">
            <h2 class="panel-heading" id="backlinks-heading">Backlinks</h2>
          </div>
          <nav class="backlinks" id="backlinks" aria-label="Backlinks">
          </nav>
        </section>
        <section class="panel" id="tags-panel" aria-labelledby="tags-heading">
          <div class="panel-header">
            <h2 class="panel-heading" id="tags-heading">Tags</h2>
          </div>
          <nav class="tags" id="tags" aria-label="Tags">
          </nav>
        </section>
      </aside>
      <!-- The right rail mirrors the left one across the page: the same strip of
       chrome closing the grid at the far edge, and the home of the reader's
       app-level controls and the floating window's switches. Search and the
       theme belong to the whole reader; each of the other switches answers for
       one view of the one floating panel window, the way the sidebar's
       switches answer for its two views: an unlit one brings its view up, a
       lit one puts the window away. -->
      <div class="rail rail-end" id="rail-end">
        <button class="icon-button"
                id="search-toggle"
                type="button"
                aria-label="Search documents"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="search-panel"
                title="Search documents (Ctrl+F)">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7" />
            <path d="M16.5 16.5 21 21" />
          </svg>
        </button>
        <button class="icon-button"
                id="theme-toggle"
                type="button"
                aria-label="Switch colour theme"
                aria-pressed="false"
                title="Switch colour theme">
          <svg class="icon-moon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M20 14.5A8.5 8.5 0 0 1 9.5 4a8.5 8.5 0 1 0 10.5 10.5z" />
          </svg>
          <svg class="icon-sun" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" />
            <path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M2 12h2M20 12h2M4.9 4.9l1.4 1.4M17.7 17.7l1.4 1.4M19.1 4.9l-1.4 1.4M6.3 17.7l-1.4 1.4" />
          </svg>
        </button>
        <button class="icon-button"
                id="graph-global-toggle"
                type="button"
                aria-label="Show global graph"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="graph-global-panel"
                title="Show global graph">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2" /><circle cx="5" cy="5" r="2" /><circle cx="19" cy="5" r="2" /><circle cx="5" cy="19" r="2" /><circle cx="19" cy="19" r="2" />
            <path d="M6.6 6.6l3.8 3.8M17.4 6.6l-3.8 3.8M6.6 17.4l3.8-3.8M17.4 17.4l-3.8-3.8" />
          </svg>
        </button>
        <button class="icon-button"
                id="graph-local-toggle"
                type="button"
                aria-label="Show local graph"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="graph-local-panel"
                title="Show local graph">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="5.5" cy="6.5" r="2.5" /><circle cx="18.5" cy="6.5" r="2.5" /><circle cx="12" cy="17.5" r="2.5" />
            <path d="M7.6 8.4 10.6 15.7M16.4 8.4 13.4 15.7M8 6.5h8" />
          </svg>
        </button>
        <button class="icon-button"
                id="backlinks-toggle"
                type="button"
                aria-label="Show backlinks"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="backlinks-panel"
                title="Show backlinks">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="11" y="5" width="10" height="14" rx="2" />
            <path d="M2 12h6M5.5 9.5 8 12l-2.5 2.5" />
          </svg>
        </button>
        <button class="icon-button"
                id="tags-toggle"
                type="button"
                aria-label="Show tags"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="tags-panel"
                title="Show tags">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M4 4h7l9 9-7 7-9-9V4Z" />
            <circle cx="8" cy="8" r="1.6" />
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>
      <!-- The search panel is the app's own dialog: it belongs to the app, not to
       the panel whose picture it would otherwise cover. -->
      <div class="search-panel" id="search-panel" hidden></div>
      <div class="drawer-backdrop" id="drawer-backdrop" hidden></div>
    </div>
    <script id="wikicc-payload" type="application/json">{{ payload|safe }}</script>
    <script>{{ js|safe }}</script>
  </body>
</html>
